nes,\npainterly filter, pixelation, posterize, grading) plus post settings, and lighting (mood, sun, sky, fog).\nWorkflow: list_presets -> apply a preset -> screenshot -> apply again with only the layer to tweak -> define_preset to keep it.\nPresets are data: built in, overridable/extendable from Config/RuntimeToolsets/StylePresets.json or define_preset.\nSee the art_style skill.","tools":[{"name":"apply","function":"Apply","description":"Restyles the whole scene: a preset and/or overrides of any layer, merged key by key. Without a preset, overrides tweak the style already applied. The material/post layer is one undo step; the lighting layer adds lighting undo steps.\nReturns: The applied style and any lighting notes. Fails if the preset is unknown (the hint lists the presets) or the style assets are missing.","input_schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"material":{"description":"{Weathering 0-1 scene-wide dirt, rain streaks and dust (realistic 0.2-0.4, default 0.25), Faceted 0-1 flat shading, Pattern 0-1 procedural detail, Steps colour palette steps (0 off), Saturation, RimStrength, RimColor, Tint}, e.g. {\"Saturation\": 1.2}. (Any JSON value)"},"post":{"description":"{Toon 0-1, Bands, ShadowFloor, Outline 0-1, OutlineWidth px, OutlineColor, DepthSens, NormalSens, Paint 0-1, PaintRadius, PaintScale, PixelSize px, Levels, Saturation, Contrast, Tint}, e.g. {\"Outline\": 0.6}. (Any JSON value)"},"settings":{"description":"{bloom, vignette, ao, grain, chromatic, exposure_bias, temperature}. (Any JSON value)"},"lighting":{"description":"{mood, sun:{rotation, intensity, temperature, color}, sky:{intensity, color}, fog:{density, color, height_falloff}}. (Any JSON value)"},"preset":{"type":"string","description":"Preset name, e.g. \"toon\"; empty = tweak the current style.","default":""},"lighting_enabled":{"type":"boolean","description":"Also change the lighting.","default":true}},"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"returnValue":{"type":"object","title":"RuntimeStyleInfo","properties":{"applied":{"type":"boolean","description":"Whether a style is applied (get only; false = engine defaults)."},"style":{"description":"The style: {name, description, material:{...}, post:{...}, settings:{...}, lighting:{...}}. (Any JSON value)"},"lighting_notes":{"type":"string","description":"Problems while applying the lighting layer (missing sun or fog, ...), empty if none."}},"description":"The applied style and any lighting notes. Fails if the preset is unknown (the hint lists the presets) or the style assets are missing."}},"required":["returnValue"]},"undoable":true,"irreversible":false,"requires_world":true,"async":false},{"name":"define_preset","function":"DefinePreset","description":"Adds or replaces a named style preset, optionally starting from another preset. Lasts until the game restarts (put permanent presets in Config/RuntimeToolsets/StylePresets.json).\nReturns: The new preset. Fails if the name is empty or based_on is not a preset.","input_schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"name":{"type":"string","description":"Preset name, e.g. \"comic\"."},"material":{"description":"Material layer overrides. (Any JSON value)"},"post":{"description":"Post layer overrides, e.g. {\"OutlineWidth\": 3}. (Any JSON value)"},"settings":{"description":"Post settings overrides. (Any JSON value)"},"lighting":{"description":"Lighting overrides. (Any JSON value)"},"based_on":{"type":"string","description":"Start from this preset, e.g. \"toon\".","default":""},"description":{"type":"string","description":"What it looks like.","default":"Custom style"}},"required":["name"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"returnValue":{"type":"object","title":"RuntimeStyleInfo","properties":{"applied":{"type":"boolean","description":"Whether a style is applied (get only; false = engine defaults)."},"style":{"description":"The style: {name, description, material:{...}, post:{...}, settings: